vFM Player - Test files

SD folder: /vFM/tests

Optional examples and diagnostics. These folders are excluded from ENTIRE SD playback. Browse them explicitly to run tests. Do not put your normal music collection here.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/tests

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
